Ka khia — ka shon hanga kam don; 

Ka met ka jlih, ka rong ka tlem, 

Kum ’Si — Mahadek ba iaid khlem Sem. 

Myrsiang Sadew, Phyllad Nongpriang, 
Shimiet iashai ki ieng ka Krang; 

Kyrpong Sem-Syiar ruh bad Semblang, 
Rewngap na Ksing ruh ba kin phriang. 

Tang mar ia ioh Jylla lajong. 

District thymmai nga la pynlong; 

Ba yn khamjan Sorkar lajong, 

Ba jngai than eb naduh Shillong. 

Ban roi ban par ka thain Kynshi, 

Iaka nga jer Khasi-Sepngi ; 

Ka jer ka thoh m ardor Pynkloi ; 

Ryngkat ka Tap ka Shup ban roi. 

Haba la ai la ka Kyrteng, 

Katto artad Rangbah kan Ieng; 

Ban sah ka nam-burom pateng,
